# OENEXA Explorer Developer & AI Agent Rules
# MANDATORY FOR ALL AI AGENTS & DEVELOPERS

## Core Principles
1. ZERO-BUG & BUILD PASSING MANDATE:
   - Always run `npm run build` (`tsc && vite build`) before any commit.
   - Zero TypeScript errors and zero build warnings allowed.
   - Pushing unverified or failing code to `main` is strictly forbidden.

2. SECURITY & RPC RESILIENCE:
   - Never expose validator credentials or private keys in the client bundle.
   - All RPC queries to `oenexa-node` (port 8545) must handle disconnections and fallback gracefully.
   - See `DEVELOPER_AND_AI_RULES.md` for complete enforcement policies.
